      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middletown%2C_Kentucky",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A branch of the Louisville Free Public Library serves Middletown residents, linking the town to the larger Louisville library system.",
